# Project Recreation Guide: Drawing Book

This document contains all the details, credentials, and instructions needed to recreate the **Drawing Book** application.

## 1. Project Overview
- **Name**: Drawing Book
- **Type**: Single Page Application (SPA) / Progressive Web App (PWA)
- **Tech Stack**: React (Vite), Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion, React PageFlip.
- **Backend Service**: Dropbox API (for storage).

